      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Rengar's predatory instincts take over, Camouflaging him and revealing the nearest enemy champion in a large radius around him. During Thrill of the Hunt, Rengar gains Move Speed and he can leap to the tracked enemy without being in brush, reducing their armor.",
      "summary_zh": "雷恩加尔激活他的掠食者本能，伪装自身并感知附近极大范围内的距他最近的敌方英雄。在狩猎律动期间，他会获得移动速度加成，他的下次攻击将使他即使不在草丛内也可以进行跳跃，并且会减少目标的护甲。",
